        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kandih khou hei gailiangmei poubaumei Jisu,",
            "Tingkauh kaguang bam lou duna rianra khang e;",
            "Rianramei tei thai sini,",
            "Thei khang tei ping makge poubaumei Jisu.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Gai pui tingmik (3),",
            "Poubaumei puan ne.",
            "",
            "2. Nthanmei bangpui khou!@9 puanne Jisu tei,",
            "Kandihmei lun kumma ngana suna puan the;",
            "Bethlehem kailuang lakhou,",
            "Khoutei poubaumei puanne mansei lun phunga.",
            "",
            "3. Raguang !@9 kana ndiu louna jao bamme,",
            "Papbang nun guai !@9 kanloumei bam lakhang tei !@9;",
            "Bumang thanmei la khang tei,",
            "Kandihmei pap phung lou khang ndiu keilou the.",
            "",
            "4. Kagan kathui kanpat pui bam lakhang lat din lou,",
            "Kross rukhou rianra khanga kajei keilou kanthe;",
            "Tarou khou neithum jipma,",
            "Kapu bam khou bamdat khang tingkauh kukan the."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
